  <participating-org role="4" type="24">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ROADS is a coalition of associations fighting for the well-being of the environment from a sustainable development perspective. Itsmain target groups are environmental defense associations, natural resource management committees, district and provincialfarmers&apos; unions, and study circle groups in Niassa province. The existence of ROADS strengthens the communication mechanisms between community associations, the government and the private sector on issues related to the environment and sustainable development. The general objective of ROADS is to reverse environmental degradation in Niassa Province through prevention, public access to environmental information, land management and the promotion of biodiversity conservation.</narrative>
